This directory contains python code for make HTML mission pages from template and .json format descriptors

write_html.py           Python code. Reads all .json files in input_json/ and uses
                        a Jinga Flash template to generate HTML files. All files
                        are written to static_output/

missions_template.html  Jinga Flask template file for placing .json settings into HTML

templates/              Other example Flash HTML templates for rapid prototyping

blank.json              Example .json with all supported settings (no content)

input_json/             Complete set of all mission (except GOF pages) .json settings

gof_json/               Complete set of all mission GOF page .json settings


HOW TO USE

Clone to your local system, then run the code

% python ./write_html.py

The resulting output files can be copied to the SED gitlab for uswds-static-output.